{"strongs": "H6908", "word": "קָבַץ", "translit": "qa.vats", "root": "קבץ", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "gather, collect", "definition": "קָבַץ 127 verb gather, collect (synonym אָסַף ) (Arabic grasp, seize ; Sabean קבץֿ harvest , in ׳ דֿק , attribute of 'Attar, according to Fell ZMG liv (1900), 237 f. ; Ethiopic is fail, despair ; Late Hebrew קִבָּץ = Biblical Hebrew); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ ק 1Kgs 20:1 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִקְבָּץֿ Ps 41:7 , וַיִּקְכֹּץ Gen 41:48 +, etc.; Imperative masculine singular קְבֹץ 1Kgs 18:19 , masculine plural קִבְצוּ 1Sam 7:5 +; Infinitive construct suffix לְקָבְצִי Zeph 3:8 Participle active קֹבֵץ Ezek 22:19 ; Prov 13:11 passive plural קְכוּצִים Neh 5:16 — gather, collect: 1. with accusative of thing, grain Gen 41:35 ; Gen 41:48 ( E ), booty Deut 13:17 (+ אֶל location), money 2Chr 24:5 (+ מִן person), so Ezek 16:31 ( Gr Toy Krae , reading לִקְבֹּץ from לְקַלֵּס , compare ᵐ5 ᵑ6 . Symm ); accusative omitted קֹבֵץ Prov 13:11 one gathering by degrees; figurative אָֿוֶן לוֺ ׳ לִבּוֺ יִק Ps 41:7 his heart gathereth wickedness to itself. 2. usually with accusative of person gather, assemble , + ה locative 1Sam 7:5 ; 1Sam 29:1 (for battle); + אֶל location 1Kgs 18:20 ; Ezra 8:15 ; Esth 2:3 + אֶל person 2Sam 3:21 ; Hab 2:5 (in figurative; || אָסַף ); + עַל (= אֶל ) person 1Kgs 11:24 + אֶל person and location 1Kgs 18:19 ; 2Chr 32:6 + מִן local 2Chr 23:2 , compare Ezra 7:28 accusative of person alone 1Kgs 22:6 = 2Chr 18:5 ; 2Kgs 10:18 ; Neh 7:5 (+ infinitive purpose), Joel 2:16 (|| אָסַף ), 2Chr 15:9 ; 2Chr 24:5 ; 2Chr 25:5 passive with שָׁם + עַל of work Neh 5:16 for ׳ י 's judgement Zeph 3:3 (|| אָסַף ), Ezek 22:20 compare v Ezek 22:19 (+ אֶלאתּוֺךְ ; figurative of metals into furnace); specifically for war, battle, Judg 12:4 ; 1Sam 28:1 ; 2Sam 2:30 ; 1Kgs 20:1 ; 2Kgs 6:24 + לַצָּבָא 1Sam 28:1 ( 1Sam 29:1 see above). Niph`al Perfect 3 plural נִקְבְּצוּ Josh 10:6 +, etc.; Imperfect 2 masculine singular תִּקָּבֵץ Ezek 29:5 3 masculine plural וַיִּקָּֽבְצוּ 1Sam 7:6 +, etc.; Imperative masculine plural הִקָּֽבְצוּ Gen 49:2 +; Infinitive construct הִקָּבֵץ Ezra 10:7 +; Participle plural נִקְבָּצִים Jer 40:15 , suffix נִקְבָּצָיו Isa 56:8 — 1. intransitive assemble, gather 1Sam 25:1 ; Gen 49:2 ; Isa 45:20 ; Isa 48:14 ; Isa 49:18 ; Isa 60:4 ; Joel 4:11 ; 2Chr 20:4 (+ infinitive purpose) 2Chr 32:4 for war 1Sam 28:4 ; Josh 10:6 (with אֶל against ); with ה locative 1Sam 7:6 , accusative of location Ezra 10:7 ; Ezra 10:9 ; 2Chr 15:10 with אֶל person unto Jer 40:15 ; 1Chr 13:2 ; Ezra 10:1 ; Neh 4:14 , compare 2Chr 13:7 ( עַל for אֶל ); אֶל person + ה locative 1Chr 11:1 with יַחְדָּו Hos 2:2 ; Isa 43:9 (|| אָסַף ), Ps 102:23 of birds and beasts Isa 34:15 (with שָׁם ), Ezek 39:17 . 2. passive be gathered Isa 60:7 (of flocks, + ל person), Esth 2:8 ( + אֶל location), v Esth 2:19 participle with suffix person Isa 56:8 ; Ezek 29:5 (|| אסף ) read תִּקָּבֵר Hi (not Sm ) Co Berthol Toy Krae . Pi`el 51 Perfect 3 masculine singular suffix וְקִכֶּצְךָ Deut 30:3 consecutive, קִבְּצָם Mic 4:12 ; Ps 107:3 , קִכְּצָן Isa 34:16 3 feminine singular קִבָּ֑צָה Isa 1:7 , etc.; Imperfect יְקַבֵּץ Isa 11:12 ; Isa 40:11 , etc.; Imperative, masculine singular suffix קַכְּצֵנוּ 1Chr 16:35 ; Ps 106:47 Infinitive absolute קַכֵּץ Mic 2:12 construct קַכֵּץ Isa 66:13 etc.; Participle מְקַכֵּץ Nah 3:18 +, etc.; — gather together: 1. usually of ׳ י gathering his dispersed people (accusative), sometimes under figure of flock: Mic 2:12 + infinitive absolute (|| אָסַף ), Mic 4:6 ; Zeph 3:19 ; Zeph 3:20 ; Jer 31:10 ; Zech 10:8 ; Isa 54:7 ; Isa 56:8 a, compare also Isa 40:11 with accusative + מִן local Deut 30:3 ; Deut 30:4 ; Jer 23:5 ; Jer 29:14 ; Jer 31:8 ; Jer 32:37 ; Ezek 11:17 + 6 t. Ezekiel + Ezek 37:21 ( מִסָּבִיב ), Isa 11:12 ; Isa 43:5 ; Zech 10:10 ; Neh 1:9 Psalm + Neh 106:4 , compare || 1Chr 16:35 ; Ps 107:3 accusative + עַל person Isa 56:8 b (compare Niph`al Participle ); = ( gather and) restrain Hos 8:10 (with accusative alone); of ׳ י gathering dispersed Egyptians, accusative + מִן local Ezek 29:13 gathering the nations (accusative) for judgment Mic 4:12 ; Isa 66:18 ; Joel 4:2 gathering lovers of Jerusalem (under figure of harlot) Ezek 16:37 (twice in verse) ( מִסָּבִיב + עַל person against ); gathering beasts into Edom Isa 34:16 . 2. men subject: מִצְרַיִם תְּקַבְּצֵם מֹף תְּקַבְּרֵם Hos 9:6 (compare Ezek 29:5 Niph`al , above), Neh 13:11 with accusative of thing Mic 1:7 (+ מִן ), Isa 22:9 ; Isa 62:9 ; Prov 28:8 אֵין מְקַבֵּץ none that gathereth Isa 13:14 (accusative omitted), Nah 3:18 ( id. ), Jer 49:5 (followed by לַֹנּדֵד , compare ל 3 near the end). 3. perhaps ( gather and so) take away (= אָסַף 4 ), Nah 2:11 ; Joel 2:6 see פָּארוּר . Pu`al Participle מְקֻבֶּצֶת Ezek 38:8 (with מִן ) of land (for people) of Israel Hithpa`el gather together (intransitive), be gathered together. Perfect 3 plural הִתְקַבְּצוּ Judg 9:47 ; 1Sam 7:7 (+ ה locative); Imperfect 3 masculine plural וַיִּתְקַבְּצוּ 1Sam 8:2 ; 1Sam 22:2 (+ אֶל person), ׳ יִתְק Isa 44:11 for battle, war, Imperative masculine plural הַתְקַבְּצוּ Jer 49:14 Imperfect also Josh 9 : (with יִחְדָּו , + infinitive purpose), + אַחֲרֵי person 2Sam 2:25 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7286')\">BDB7286</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6908')\">H6908</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7285')\">BDB7285</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7287')\">BDB7287</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָבַץ</bdbheb><sub>127</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>gather, collect</highlightword> (synonym <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb>) (Arabic <placeholder4672/> <highlight>grasp, seize</highlight>; Sabean <bdbheb>קבץֿ</bdbheb> <highlight>harvest</highlight>, in <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דֿק</bdbheb>, attribute of 'Attar, according to Fell<sup>ZMG liv (1900), 237 f.</sup>; Ethiopic <placeholder4673/> is <highlight>fail, despair</highlight>; Late Hebrew <bdbheb>קִבָּץ</bdbheb> = Biblical Hebrew); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,1)\">1Kgs 20:1</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִקְבָּץֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 41:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,41,7)\">Ps 41:7</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּקְכֹּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:48\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,48)\">Gen 41:48</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>קְבֹץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,19)\">1Kgs 18:19</ref>, masculine plural <bdbheb>קִבְצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,5)\">1Sam 7:5</ref> +; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>לְקָבְצִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:8\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,8)\">Zeph 3:8</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbheb>קֹבֵץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,19)\">Ezek 22:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,11)\">Prov 13:11</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> plural <bdbheb>קְכוּצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 5:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,16)\">Neh 5:16</ref> — <highlight>gather, collect:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> with accusative of thing, grain <ref ref=\"Gen 41:35\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,35)\">Gen 41:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 41:48\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,48)\">Gen 41:48</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), booty <ref ref=\"Deut 13:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,17)\">Deut 13:17</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> location), money <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,5)\">2Chr 24:5</ref> (+ <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> person), so <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:31\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,31)\">Ezek 16:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> Toy <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Krae')\">Krae</lookup>, reading <bdbheb>לִקְבֹּץ</bdbheb> from <bdbheb>לְקַלֵּס</bdbheb>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Symm')\"><reflink>Symm</reflink></lookup>); accusative omitted <bdbheb>קֹבֵץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 13:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,11)\">Prov 13:11</ref> <highlight>one gathering</highlight> by degrees; figurative <bdbheb>אָֿוֶן לוֺ</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לִבּוֺ יִק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 41:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,41,7)\">Ps 41:7</ref> <highlight>his heart gathereth wickedness to itself.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> usually with accusative of person <highlight>gather, assemble</highlight>, + <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,5)\">1Sam 7:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 29:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,29,1)\">1Sam 29:1</ref> (for battle); + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,20)\">1Kgs 18:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:15\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,15)\">Ezra 8:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 2:3\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,3)\">Esth 2:3</ref> + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:21\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,21)\">2Sam 3:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 2:5\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,5)\">Hab 2:5</ref> (in figurative; || <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb>); + <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> (= <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb>) person <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,24)\">1Kgs 11:24</ref> + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> person and location <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,19)\">1Kgs 18:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,6)\">2Chr 32:6</ref> + <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> local <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,2)\">2Chr 23:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:28\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,28)\">Ezra 7:28</ref> accusative of person alone <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,6)\">1Kgs 22:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,5)\">2Chr 18:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,18)\">2Kgs 10:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,5)\">Neh 7:5</ref> (+ infinitive purpose), <ref ref=\"Joel 2:16\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,16)\">Joel 2:16</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 15:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,15,9)\">2Chr 15:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,5)\">2Chr 24:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 25:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,25,5)\">2Chr 25:5</ref> passive with <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> of work <ref ref=\"Neh 5:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,16)\">Neh 5:16</ref> for <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s judgement <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:3\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,3)\">Zeph 3:3</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,20)\">Ezek 22:20</ref> compare v<ref ref=\"Ezek 22:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,19)\">Ezek 22:19</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֶלאתּוֺךְ</bdbheb>; figurative of metals into furnace); specifically for war, battle, <ref ref=\"Judg 12:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,12,4)\">Judg 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 28:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,28,1)\">1Sam 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 2:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,2,30)\">2Sam 2:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,1)\">1Kgs 20:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 6:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,6,24)\">2Kgs 6:24</ref> + <bdbheb>לַצָּבָא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 28:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,28,1)\">1Sam 28:1</ref> (<ref ref=\"1Sam 29:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,29,1)\">1Sam 29:1</ref> see above). <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>נִקְבְּצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 10:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,6)\">Josh 10:6</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תִּקָּבֵץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,5)\">Ezek 29:5</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיִּקָּֽבְצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,6)\">1Sam 7:6</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine plural <bdbheb>הִקָּֽבְצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,2)\">Gen 49:2</ref> +; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הִקָּבֵץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:7\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,7)\">Ezra 10:7</ref> +; <highlight>Participle</highlight> plural <bdbheb>נִקְבָּצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 40:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,40,15)\">Jer 40:15</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>נִקְבָּצָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 56:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,8)\">Isa 56:8</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> intransitive <highlight>assemble, gather</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,1)\">1Sam 25:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 49:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,2)\">Gen 49:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,20)\">Isa 45:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 48:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,14)\">Isa 48:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"I