\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,14)\">Neh 4:14</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,7)\">2Chr 13:7</ref> (<bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> person + <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,1)\">1Chr 11:1</ref> with <bdbheb>יַחְדָּו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 2:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,2)\">Hos 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 43:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,9)\">Isa 43:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 102:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,23)\">Ps 102:23</ref> of birds and beasts <ref ref=\"Isa 34:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,15)\">Isa 34:15</ref> (with <bdbheb>שָׁם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,17)\">Ezek 39:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> passive <highlight>be gathered</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 60:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,7)\">Isa 60:7</ref> (of flocks, + <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> person), <ref ref=\"Esth 2:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,8)\">Esth 2:8</ref> ( + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> location), v<ref ref=\"Esth 2:19\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,19)\">Esth 2:19</ref> participle with suffix person <ref ref=\"Isa 56:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,8)\">Isa 56:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,5)\">Ezek 29:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אסף</bdbheb>) read <bdbheb>תִּקָּבֵר</bdbheb> <look