"bcv(23,66,13)\">Isa 66:13</ref> etc.; Participle<bdbheb>מְקַכֵּץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 3:18\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,18)\">Nah 3:18</ref> +, etc.; — <highlight>gather together:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> usually of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> gathering his dispersed people (accusative), sometimes under figure of flock: <ref ref=\"Mic 2:12\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(33,2,12)\">Mic 2:12</ref> + infinitive absolute (|| <bdbheb>אָסַף</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Mic 4:6\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,6)\">Mic 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:19\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,19)\">Zeph 3:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:20\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,20)\">Zeph 3:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 31:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,10)\">Jer 31:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 10:8\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(38,10,8)\">Zech 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 54:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,7)\">Isa 54:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 56:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,8)\">Isa 56:8</ref>a, compare also <ref ref=\"Isa 40:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,11)\">Isa 40:11</ref> with accusative + <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> local <ref ref=\"Deut 30:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,3)\">Deut 30:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 30:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,4)\">Deut 30:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 23:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,5)\">Jer 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,14)\">Jer 29:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 31:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,8)\">Jer 31:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:37\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,37)\">Jer 32:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,17)\">Ezek 11:17</ref> + 6 t. Ezekiel + <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,21)\">Ezek 37:21</ref> (<bdbheb>מִסָּבִיב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Isa 11:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,12)\">Isa 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 43:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,5)\">Isa 43:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 10:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,10,10)\">Zech 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 1:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,9)\">Neh 1:9</ref> Psalm + <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Neh 106:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,106,4)\">Neh 106:4</ref>, compare || <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:35\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,35)\">1Chr 16:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 107:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,3)\">Ps 107:3</ref> accusative + <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Isa 56:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,8)\">Isa 56:8</ref>b (compare <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight>); = (<highlight>gather</highlight> and) restrain <ref ref=\"Hos 8:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,10)\">Hos 8:10</ref> (with accusative alone); of